  Cpu, HardDrive, Network, Eye, BarChart2, PieChart as PieChartIcon, LineChart as LineChartIcon, Layers, Bell, X,
  TrendingDown, Percent, Timer, Gauge, Monitor, Server, CloudOff, Power, FileUp,
